WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.720
This is the Roseway CRM, one place to win new property partners and to take care of

2
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.120
the residents who live in their communities.

3
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.440
Every day starts on the dashboard.

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:18.080
Open leads, hot prospects, consultations and pipeline revenue sit right up top.

5
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:23.320
Below, you can follow every deal through the leasing and onboarding stages, see how warm

6
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:28.840
your leads are running, and pick up where you left off with your most recent opportunities.

7
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:34.220
The leads page holds every prospective property partner, the contact, the community and its

8
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:40.120
management company, its size, its asset class, and its resident experience score.

9
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:46.540
Filter by stage, temperature, or source, and import or export your list in seconds.

10
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:52.280
In the pipeline, each deal moves across the board, from new lead, to contacted, qualified,

11
00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.520
discovery call, proposal, and pilot term.

12
00:00:55.520 --> 00:01:01.380
Drag a card forward as the conversation progresses, while total pipeline value, average deal size

13
00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.240
and win rate update live.

14
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.840
Outreach logs every touch with a prospective partner, across email, calls, LinkedIn and

15
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:15.200
meetings, so you can see at a glance who replied and what's booked next.

16
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:20.640
Once a partner is won, their communities appear under properties, each one showing its units,

17
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.900
its residents, and its open caseload.

18
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:29.180
The residents directory covers everyone across your partner communities, with their status,

19
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:36.260
their experience score, and any open cases, so at-risk residents never slip through the cracks.

20
00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.260
Resident requests flow through the case pipeline.

21
00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:44.980
Every case is tagged by priority and category, from maintenance to billing and lease questions,

22
00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:50.420
and moves from intake, to in progress, to awaiting resident, with overdue items flagged

23
00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.500
in red.

24
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.500
This pulls every follow-up into one list.

25
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:01.780
Pipeline calls and case deadlines alike, so the team always knows exactly what's due today.

26
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.980
And reports and analytics shows the health of the whole operation.

27
00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:11.600
Open cases, average resolution time, at-risk residents, and how the caseload breaks down

28
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:15.580
by priority, all updating live.

29
00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:23.500
Leads, outreach, pipeline, partners, residents, cases, insights, one CRM from the first conversation

30
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.220
to everyday resident care.

31
00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.940
Roseway CRM.

32
00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.300
Grow your partnerships and care for every resident.

